{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPERSWEEP is a sleek and modern reimagining of the classic Minesweeper, rebuilt with intense visuals, satisfying chain reactions, and ultra-challenging grids. This is logic at its most dangerous one wrong move, and it's game over...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPERSWEEP pushes your skills to the limit with larger grid sizes or smaller for beginners, and customizable modes, including 3 secret modes! Every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re easing into logic puzzles or ready to challenge your memory and deduction, SUPERSWEEP delivers gameplay that\u2019s both meditative and high-stakes. Every tile is a mystery. Every cleared zone is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flag bombs, clear safe spaces, and watch massive sections of the board reveal themselves in animated bursts. With glowing visuals, a moody atmosphere, and smooth transitions, this isn't just a puzzle it's a experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic tile-based logic gameplay with no guessing and no RNG traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain-reaction reveals that explode across the board when you uncover safe zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty scaling from beginner boards to massive 51\u00d751 sweeper gauntlets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, glowing aesthetic with crisp sound design for a clean, immersive feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties, hidden challenges, and [REDACTED] secrets to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran Minesweeper strategist or a curious newcomer, SUPERSWEEP offers a rewarding test of logic, memory, and guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you step up onto the plate? Or will you blow it?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"That was easy...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2829140/04eb528f42a663077c3094699636ec2767635f97.jpg"},{"name":"I understand it now...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2829140/1a63a1be4a41e02321afd2d0a26ae78a474fb96a.jpg"},{"name":"No way, is that it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2829140/3b63eeb666764f5ad314e85cd52666664f5b03ba.jpg"},{"name":"You thought it was over?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2829140/de8babaaa95edc836cf82a304e4f4ee2e9ec3a43.jpg"},{"name":"Patience...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2829140/12e9a9ac9fbc1ff19fc7097756a80ad22b608bc7.jpg"},{"name":"SUPERSWEEPER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2829140/1361bdc32c0b107cfc85ab4f0459ed1d333a406e.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829140?t=1759338204","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829140?t=1759338204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829140/f18439af45a45db84a92ad05c2f6823633c9bb57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759338204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829140/f18439af45a45db84a92ad05c2f6823633c9bb57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759338204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPERSWEEP is a sleek and modern reimagining of the classic Minesweeper, rebuilt with intense visuals, satisfying chain reactions, and ultra-challenging grids. This is logic at its most dangerous one wrong move, and it's game over...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPERSWEEP pushes your skills to the limit with larger grid sizes or smaller for beginners, and customizable modes, including 3 secret modes! Every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re easing into logic puzzles or ready to challenge your memory and deduction, SUPERSWEEP delivers gameplay that\u2019s both meditative and high-stakes. Every tile is a mystery. Every cleared zone is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flag bombs, clear safe spaces, and watch massive sections of the board reveal themselves in animated bursts. With glowing visuals, a moody atmosphere, and smooth transitions, this isn't just a puzzle it's a experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic tile-based logic gameplay with no guessing and no RNG traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain-reaction reveals that explode across the board when you uncover safe zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty scaling from beginner boards to massive 51\u00d751 sweeper gauntlets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, glowing aesthetic with crisp sound design for a clean, immersive feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties, hidden challenges, and [REDACTED] secrets to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran Minesweeper strategist or a curious newcomer, SUPERSWEEP offers a rewarding test of logic, memory, and guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you step up onto the plate? Or will you blow it?</p>","developers":["Vedat Ulas"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829140/18056e61b8f4fcc552d25b64ab68d06abb18d6d9/header.jpg?t=1759338204","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2829140/438391554/3745c5712f05bdba9a461a74a4f2a1e8a5b900e7/1753554186/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753554772","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2829140/438391554/3745c5712f05bdba9a461a74a4f2a1e8a5b900e7/1753554186/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753554772","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2829140/438391554/3745c5712f05bdba9a461a74a4f2a1e8a5b900e7/1753554186/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753554772","id":257174341,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174341/movie480.mp4?t=1753554772","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174341/movie_max.mp4?t=1753554772"},"name":"SUPERSWEEP Pre-Release Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174341/420590f2c04365bf554c657b0abb0ace978ae4f3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753554772","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174341/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753554772","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174341/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753554772"}}],"name":"SUPERSWEEP","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"SUPERSWEEP - $4.99 USD","p